<title>FINLAND: HANSAPANK JAN-SEPT PROFIT UP 25 PCT.</title>
<headline>HANSAPANK JAN-SEPT PROFIT UP 25 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian bank Hansapank said in a statement on Tuesday its January-September net profit was 128.2 million Estonian kroons, up 25 percent on the corresponding period in 1995.</p>
</text>
